To update MANIFEST.MF_patch for newer versions of dependencies, do the following:

1. unzip yajsw-stable-13.11.zip
2. cd yajsw-stable-13.11/build
3. cp MANIFEST.MF MANIFEST.MF.updated
4. patch MANIFEST.MF.updated < AWIPS2_build/installers/RPMs/yajsw/patches/build/MANIFEST.MF_patch
4. Update the version numbers in MANIFEST.MF.updated for the new FOSS version.
5. diff MANIFEST.MF MANIFEST.MF.updated > MANIFEST.MF_patch
6. cp MANIFEST.MF_patch to AWIPS2_build/installers/RPMs/yajsw/patches/build/

That theoretically should be it. A similar approach can be done for
build.gradle_patch if component.spec is updated with how it runs the patch
command.
